  "bio": "Victoria Guimarães is an exceptionally talented tattoo artist based in The Hague, Netherlands, who excels in illustrative, floral and anime styles. Splitting her time between the reputable studios of The9MusesTattoo and ItaiTattoo, she showcases a stunning level of detail and creativity, marking her as a standout artist in her field. Victoria's bookings are always open, further demonstrating her commitment to her art.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: The Hague, South Holland, Netherlands\n\nYahaha! You found me! \n⛩️ Den Haag - @itaitattoo",
